From 89fbf280b4cfb4c1d091fe1a99483c36b0404d54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Frederik Richter <frederik.richter@mailbox.org>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 13:22:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(config/render): unify sdr and hdr brightness settings in
 monitor definition

- Add hdrbrightness monitor rule setting to scale HDR content brightness on HDR monitors
- Add unified brightness monitor rule setting to adjust both SDR and HDR brightness simultaneously
- Add Lua config bindings for brightness and hdrbrightness in hl.monitor rules
- Integrate HDR brightness scaling into Renderer's color management pipeline (sdrBrightnessMultiplier / needsMod)
- Adjust tone mapping maxLuminance dynamically when HDR brightness is scaled
- Expose hdrBrightness in hyprctl monitors JSON and text outputs
- Add unit test coverage in tests/config/MonitorParser.cpp for brightness and hdrbrightness parsing
